# Frankly episodes numbered 1 through 25, split out of episodes.ttl
# as the third real pilot for the TGS/RR/Frankly three-way split.
#
# A genuinely different, much sparser pattern than TGS's own pilot:
# only 3 of 25 numbers were already built (11, 20, 23) -- 22 real,
# confirmed gaps, each minted here as a genuine minimal stub (real
# number/title/URL only). A real stress-test of the stub-minting
# workflow at much higher volume than either prior pilot needed.
#
# One real, direct correction made mid-build, not just during this
# pilot's own extraction: Frankly-20's real hasHost/hasGuest
# properties were reversed in the SOURCE file itself (episodes.ttl) --
# Nora Bateson interviews Nate, not the other way around, a genuine
# reversal of the show's usual format that had been asserted
# backwards. Corrected directly in episodes.ttl (not just here) per
# MJSullivan's own direct catch, since it predated this pilot and
# would have been wrong regardless of whether the split happens.
#
# No Series individuals reference any Frankly in this specific range.
# Sorted by episode number. episodes.ttl itself is left otherwise
# untouched by this pilot beyond that one real, necessary correction.
#############################################

